From c6b65ce0934666f16fce18f823d615d7e763318e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timple Raj M <timple@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Dec 2025 15:17:37 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] drivers: ipq5210: Rename chipset reference in file

Update the file to replace the chipset reference
from ipq5200 to ipq5210 for consistency.

Change-Id: I938201a37358a120376369efada704c04bd977ab
Signed-off-by: Timple Raj M <timple@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,qusb2-phy.yaml    |  2 +-
 .../phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb3-uni-phy.yaml        |  4 ++--
